stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading
  Loading --> List: Tours arrive
  Loading --> Error: Library read fails
  Error --> Loading: Refresh tours
  List --> Opening: Open a tour
  Opening --> Open: Same deal detail arrives
  Opening --> NotAvailable: Missing, inaccessible or wrong deal
  NotAvailable --> Opening: Retry tour
  Opening --> Opening: Choose another tour
  Opening --> Creating: Start a tour and invalidate earlier request
  Creating --> Creating: Ignore stale Open success or rejection
  Open --> List: Back to deal tours
  List --> Creating: Start a tour
  Creating --> Saving: Submit creation
  Saving --> Open: Creation receipt and detail arrive
  Saving --> Error: Creation refused or outcome unknown
  Open --> Dirty: Edit shortlist, route or packet
  Dirty --> Saving: Save shortlist, route or packet
  Saving --> Saved: Saved receipt and detail arrive
  Saving --> Dirty: Save refused
  Saved --> Dirty: Edit again
  Saved --> List: Browser Back or Back to deal tours
  Dirty --> Leaving: Browser Back or Forward by one or more entries, or workspace departure
  Creating --> Leaving: Leave an edited creation form
  Saving --> Leaving: Leave with a write pending
  Leaving --> Dirty: Keep editing and restore history entry
  Leaving --> Creating: Keep editing and restore edited creation
  Leaving --> Saving: Keep editing while the write finishes
  Leaving --> List: Leave tour and discard edits
  Leaving --> Closed: Leave workspace and discard edits
  Error --> Saving: Reconcile retained request
  Open --> Unavailable: Session changes
  Opening --> Unavailable: Session changes
  Creating --> Unavailable: Session changes
  Loading --> Closed: Leave workspace
  Opening --> Closed: Leave workspace
  Open --> Closed: Leave workspace
  Closed --> Closed: Ignore late reads and frame messages
  %% never Create a tour outside a deal workspace
  %% never Show another deal's detail
  %% never Let a late read repaint a closed workspace
  %% never Show server errors as tour content
  %% never Discard dirty edits without an in-app departure decision
  %% never Let an older Open or creation response replace a newer editor
